"```bash\n"
"anima service start              # 默认：systemd --user\n"
"anima service start --foreground # 前台阻塞（日志输出到 stdout）\n"
"anima service start --dev        # WebUI 源码 watch 重建（改前端后刷新页面）\n"
"anima service status\n"
"```\n"

